A13  the saddle no-go as a forecast: how many lens pairs, how many square degrees
Law: g^2 = g_N (g + a0), AQUAL mu(x) = x/(1+x).  Units G = M = a0 = d = 1 below.
rho_bar_cold = 2.2569e-27 kg/m^3  (Omega_c/Omega_b = 5.364, Omega_b h^2 = 0.0224)
kappa = 1/2 is fitted; the theory is not closed.  This script prices a prediction, it does not prove the law.

